VASENVOLT
Overview
Vasenvolt is an AI-powered platform designed to help businesses and individuals monitor, analyze, and optimize their energy consumption in real-time. By leveraging cutting-edge machine learning and data analytics, our solution provides actionable insights that drive efficiency, reduce costs, and promote sustainable energy use.

Key Features
Real-Time Monitoring: Track energy usage in real time for all connected devices and systems.

AI-Powered Insights: Our AI models analyze usage patterns to suggest optimizations, helping you save energy and reduce costs.

Custom Alerts: Get notifications when energy consumption exceeds defined thresholds, ensuring you can take immediate action.

Detailed Reports: Access easy-to-understand energy usage reports and trends to make data-driven decisions.

Integration Support: Seamlessly integrate with existing smart meters, IoT devices, and building management systems (BMS).

Sustainability Goals: Set goals for energy consumption reduction, track progress, and meet sustainability targets.

Benefits
Cost Reduction: Reduce your energy bills by identifying inefficiencies and areas for improvement.

Sustainability: Help the environment by optimizing energy use and reducing your carbon footprint.

Scalability: Designed for both small businesses and large enterprises, with scalable plans to fit your needs.

Getting Started
Sign Up: Create an account on the platform.

Connect Devices: Link your smart meters or energy management devices.

Start Monitoring: Begin monitoring energy consumption in real time.

Analyze and Optimize: Use AI insights and alerts to make changes and optimize usage.

Tech Stack
Frontend: React.js, Tailwind CSS

Backend: Node.js, Express.js

Database: MongoDB, Firebase

AI/ML: Python (TensorFlow, Scikit-learn)

Authentication: Google OAuth, JWT

Hosting: AWS, Vercel

